3e\u003ctd\u003eWi-Fi Connectivity\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eNo\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eYes\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWall Climbing\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eExcellent\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eExcellent\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWaterline Cleaning\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGood\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBetter\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFilter Access\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTop Load\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eTop Load\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eEase of Removal\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGood\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eExcellent\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBest For\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eValue-focused buyers\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFeature-focused buyers\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch2\u003eCleaning Performance\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoth cleaners share much of the same Dolphin DNA. They are designed to clean pool floors, climb walls, and remove everyday debris including leaves, dirt, insects, and fine organic matter.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe CC Plus has earned a reputation for dependable cleaning performance across thousands of residential pools. It uses Dolphin's CleverClean navigation technology to efficiently cover pool surfaces during a standard cleaning cycle.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Titan improves on that formula with enhanced mobility and a lighter chassis. In practice, cleaning performance is very similar, but the Titan tends to navigate more smoothly and maintain better coverage along walls and waterlines.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinner: \u003cstrong\u003eTitan\u003c/strong\u003e, but only by a small margin.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eSmart Features and Connectivity\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis is where the largest difference exists.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Nautilus CC Plus follows a traditional approach. You place it in the pool, press the button, and let it work. It includes a weekly scheduler but does not offer smartphone control.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Nautilus Titan adds Wi-Fi connectivity through the MyDolphin Plus app. Owners can start cleaning cycles remotely, schedule cleanings, monitor status, and manage settings directly from their phone.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor buyers who appreciate smart-home style convenience, the Titan provides a noticeably better ownership experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinner: \u003cstrong\u003eTitan\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFiltration and Debris Handling\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoth models use top-loading filter systems that are significantly easier to maintain than older bottom-access designs.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe CC Plus performs very well with normal debris loads. However, many owners eventually purchase optional ultra-fine filters when dealing with dust, pollen, or fine sediment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Titan includes an updated basket design with increased capacity and improved fine-debris handling. For pools that accumulate heavy debris or require frequent cleaning, the larger basket can reduce maintenance frequency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinner: \u003cstrong\u003eTitan\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eEase of Ownership\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoth robots are easy to operate, but the Titan introduces several quality-of-life improvements.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe redesigned body is lighter, making removal from the pool easier. It also features improved water evacuation when lifted from the water, reducing strain during handling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe CC Plus remains simple and dependable, but the Titan feels more refined during everyday use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinner: \u003cstrong\u003eTitan\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eLong-Term Value\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe CC Plus continues to be one of the strongest value propositions in robotic pool cleaners. Its lower purchase price and proven reliability make it easy to recommend to most pool owners.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Titan provides additional features and convenience, but buyers must decide whether those upgrades justify the higher cost.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf your primary goal is keeping the pool clean at the lowest practical cost, the CC Plus remains difficult to beat.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWinner: \u003cstrong\u003eCC Plus\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho Should Buy the Nautilus CC Plus?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou want the best balance of price and performance.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou do not need smartphone control.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou prefer simple operation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou want a proven model with a long track record.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eWho Should Buy the Nautilus Titan?\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou want app control and Wi-Fi connectivity.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou prefer newer technology.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou want a lighter cleaner that is easier to handle.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eYou value convenience more than minimizing purchase cost.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFinal Recommendation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor most pool owners, the \u003cstrong\u003eDolphin Nautilus CC Plus\u003c/strong\u003e remains the smarter purchase because it delivers nearly all of the cleaning performance of the Titan at a lower price.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eDolphin Nautilus Titan\u003c/strong\u003e is the better premium option for buyers who value app control, easier handling, and a more modern ownership experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf budget matters, choose the CC Plus. If convenience matters, choose the Titan.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRelated Resources\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus'\u003eDolphin Nautilus CC Plus Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan'\u003eDolphin Nautilus Titan Review\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/best-of/overall'\u003eBest Robotic Pool Cleaners\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href='/best-of/value'\u003eBest Value Robotic Pool Cleaners\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003eFrequently Asked Questions\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIs the Dolphin Nautilus Titan worth the extra money?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor buyers who want Wi-Fi connectivity, app control, and easier handling, yes. For pure cleaning performance, the CC Plus remains the better value.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDoes the Nautilus Titan clean better than the CC Plus?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCleaning performance is very similar. The Titan offers slightly better navigation and convenience features, but both deliver excellent cleaning results.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCan both robots climb walls?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eYes. Both the Nautilus CC Plus and Nautilus Titan can climb walls and clean vertical surfaces in most residential pools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhich model is easier to maintain?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBoth are easy to maintain, but the Titan's larger filter basket and lighter design make routine ownership slightly easier.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"buildId\":\"ibMnxLVRNd6eQkSmhgFst\",\"assetPrefix\":\"\",\"initialCanonicalUrl\":\"/blog/dolphin-nautilus-cc-plus-vs-nautilus-titan\",\"initialTree\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"blog\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"dolphin-nautilus-c